    <entry>
      <title>Butterfly 标签外挂使用手册</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/06/Butterfly%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/06/Butterfly%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>标签外挂是 Hexo 独有功能，不是标准 Markdown，只在 Butterfly 主题生效。</p><hr><h2 id="Note-提示块"><a href="#Note-提示块" class="headerlink" title="Note 提示块"></a>Note 提示块</h2><h3 id="基本用法"><a href="#基本用法" class="headerlink" title="基本用法"></a>基本用法</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note [颜色] [图标] [样式] %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">内容</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="三种样式对比"><a href="#三种样式对比" class="headerlink" title="三种样式对比"></a>三种样式对比</h3><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">simple</button><button type="button" class="tab">modern</button><button type="button" class="tab">flat</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><p>经典风格，左侧色块。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note simple %&#125;默认提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note primary simple %&#125;主要提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note success simple %&#125;成功提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note info simple %&#125;信息提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note warning simple %&#125;警告提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note danger simple %&#125;危险提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>圆角卡片风格。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note modern %&#125;默认提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note success modern %&#125;成功提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note warning modern %&#125;警告提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>扁平背景风格。</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note flat %&#125;默认提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note success flat %&#125;成功提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note warning flat %&#125;警告提示&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><h3 id="自定义图标"><a href="#自定义图标" class="headerlink" title="自定义图标"></a>自定义图标</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note blue &#x27;fas fa-bullhorn&#x27; %&#125;📢 通知内容&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note pink &#x27;fas fa-car-crash&#x27; %&#125;⚠️ 小心安全&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% note green &#x27;fab fa-github&#x27; %&#125;GitHub 仓库&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可选颜色：default &#x2F; blue &#x2F; pink &#x2F; red &#x2F; purple &#x2F; orange &#x2F; green</p><p>图标用 FontAwesome 类名。</p><hr><h2 id="Tabs-标签切换"><a href="#Tabs-标签切换" class="headerlink" title="Tabs 标签切换"></a>Tabs 标签切换</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% tabs 唯一名称, 默认激活序号 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- tab 选项1 --&gt;</span><br><span class="line">内容1</span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- endtab --&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- tab 选项2 --&gt;</span><br><span class="line">内容2</span><br><span class="line">&lt;!-- endtab --&gt;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endtabs %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>名称不能重复，每篇文章里只能用一次同名 tabs。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="Gallery-相册"><a href="#Gallery-相册" class="headerlink" title="Gallery 相册"></a>Gallery 相册</h2><h3 id="相册组"><a href="#相册组" class="headerlink" title="相册组"></a>相册组</h3><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">div</span> <span class="attr">class</span>=<span class="string">&quot;gallery-group-main&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;% galleryGroup 名称 描述 链接 封面图 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% galleryGroup 名称 描述 链接 封面图 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="单相册"><a href="#单相册" class="headerlink" title="单相册"></a>单相册</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% gallery %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">![图1](/img/1.jpg)</span><br><span class="line">![图2](/img/2.jpg)</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endgallery %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="按钮"><a href="#按钮" class="headerlink" title="按钮"></a>按钮</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% btn https://github.com, 访问 GitHub, fab fa-github %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>链接</td><td>跳转地址</td></tr><tr><td>文本</td><td>按钮文字</td></tr><tr><td>图标</td><td>FontAwesome 图标类名</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="复选框"><a href="#复选框" class="headerlink" title="复选框"></a>复选框</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% check 完成的任务 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% check 未完成的任务 %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="文字样式"><a href="#文字样式" class="headerlink" title="文字样式"></a>文字样式</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% bold 加粗文字 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% underline 下划线文字 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% delete 删除线文字 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% sup 上标 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% sub 下标 %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% inlinebug 标签 %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="行内代码高亮"><a href="#行内代码高亮" class="headerlink" title="行内代码高亮"></a>行内代码高亮</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% kb Ctrl %&#125; + &#123;% kb C %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>显示为 <code>Ctrl + C</code> 键盘按键样式。</p><hr><h2 id="常用速查表"><a href="#常用速查表" class="headerlink" title="常用速查表"></a>常用速查表</h2><table><thead><tr><th>标签</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&#123;% note %&#125;</code></td><td>提示块</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% tabs %&#125;</code></td><td>标签切换</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% gallery %&#125;</code></td><td>相册</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% btn %&#125;</code></td><td>按钮</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% check %&#125;</code></td><td>复选框</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% checkbox %&#125;</code></td><td>勾选框</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% timeline %&#125;</code></td><td>时间线</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#123;% button %&#125;</code></td><td>下载按钮</td></tr></tbody></table>]]></content>
      
      
