    <entry>
      <title>Butterfly 主题安装与基础配置</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/06/Butterfly%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/06/Butterfly%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="安装主题"><a href="#安装主题" class="headerlink" title="安装主题"></a>安装主题</h2><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">Git 安装（推荐）</button><button type="button" class="tab">NPM 安装</button><button type="button" class="tab">Gitee 镜像</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b master https://github.com/jerryc127/hexo-theme-butterfly.git themes/butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>升级：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> themes/butterfly</span><br><span class="line">git pull</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm i hexo-theme-butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>升级：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm update hexo-theme-butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>NPM 安装文件在 node_modules 里，不在 themes 目录。</p></blockquote></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b master https://gitee.com/immyw/hexo-theme-butterfly.git themes/butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>适合国内网络慢的情况。</p></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><h2 id="应用主题"><a href="#应用主题" class="headerlink" title="应用主题"></a>应用主题</h2><p>修改根目录 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">butterfly</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="安装渲染器"><a href="#安装渲染器" class="headerlink" title="安装渲染器"></a>安装渲染器</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-pug hexo-renderer-stylus --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="配置文件分离（重要）"><a href="#配置文件分离（重要）" class="headerlink" title="配置文件分离（重要）"></a>配置文件分离（重要）</h2><p>在根目录创建 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code>，把主题目录的 <code>_config.yml</code> 内容复制进去。</p><p><strong>好处</strong>：升级主题时不会覆盖你的配置。</p><hr><h2 id="固定文章链接（abbrlink）"><a href="#固定文章链接（abbrlink）" class="headerlink" title="固定文章链接（abbrlink）"></a>固定文章链接（abbrlink）</h2><p>中文标题会导致 URL 乱码，改标题后链接失效。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-abbrlink --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">permalink:</span> <span class="string">post/:abbrlink.html</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">abbrlink:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alg:</span> <span class="string">crc32</span>   <span class="comment"># 算法：crc16 / crc32</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rep:</span> <span class="string">hex</span>     <span class="comment"># 进制：dec / hex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：链接变成 <code>https://xxx/post/abc123.html</code>，简洁稳定。</p><hr><h2 id="代码块配置"><a href="#代码块配置" class="headerlink" title="代码块配置"></a>代码块配置</h2><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab">darker</button><button type="button" class="tab">pale night</button><button type="button" class="tab">light</button><button type="button" class="tab active">ocean</button><button type="button" class="tab">mac</button><button type="button" class="tab">mac light</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content"><p>深色背景，亮色文字，经典深色风。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>柔和深色，护眼底色。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>浅色背景，适合亮色主题。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content active"><p>海洋蓝色调。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>Mac 风格深色（推荐）。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>Mac 风格浅色。</p></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">highlight_theme:</span> <span class="string">mac</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">highlight_copy:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>       <span class="comment"># 代码复制按钮</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">highlight_height_limit:</span> <span class="number">300</span> <span class="comment"># 代码高度限制(px)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="顶部图配置"><a href="#顶部图配置" class="headerlink" title="顶部图配置"></a>顶部图配置</h2><table><thead><tr><th>配置项</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>index_img</code></td><td>主页顶部图</td></tr><tr><td><code>default_top_img</code></td><td>默认顶部图</td></tr><tr><td><code>archive_img</code></td><td>归档页顶部图</td></tr><tr><td><code>tag_img</code></td><td>标签页默认顶部图</td></tr><tr><td><code>category_img</code></td><td>分类页默认顶部图</td></tr></tbody></table><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">index_img:</span> <span class="string">/img/banner.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">default_top_img:</span> <span class="string">/img/default-bg.jpg</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>单篇文章单独设置（front-matter）：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">文章标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">top_img:</span> <span class="string">/img/post-special.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="页脚背景"><a href="#页脚背景" class="headerlink" title="页脚背景"></a>页脚背景</h2><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">footer_bg:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>   <span class="comment"># 页脚显示图片背景</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="打字粒子特效"><a href="#打字粒子特效" class="headerlink" title="打字粒子特效"></a>打字粒子特效</h2><p>鼠标点击时的粒子爆炸效果：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">activate_power_mode:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">colorful:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># 彩色粒子</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">shake:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>       <span class="comment"># 抖动效果</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>     <span class="comment"># 手机端关闭</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="背景特效"><a href="#背景特效" class="headerlink" title="背景特效"></a>背景特效</h2><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">静止彩带</button><button type="button" class="tab">动态飘动彩带</button><button type="button" class="tab">Nest 粒子连线</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_ribbon:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">size:</span> <span class="number">150</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alpha:</span> <span class="number">0.6</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">zIndex:</span> <span class="number">-1</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">click_to_change:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>静态几何线条，点击可切换。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_fluttering_ribbon:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>彩带随风飘动，更生动。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_nest:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">onmobile:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">color:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;0,0,255&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">opacity:</span> <span class="number">0.7</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">zIndex:</span> <span class="number">-1</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">count:</span> <span class="number">99</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>鼠标跟随粒子连线动画。</p></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><blockquote><p>提示：特效越多加载越慢，手机端建议只开一个或全关。</p></blockquote>]]></content>
      
      
