    <entry>
      <title>Hexo + GitHub 搭建个人博客完整指南</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/06/Hexo+GitHub%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/06/Hexo+GitHub%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="环境准备"><a href="#环境准备" class="headerlink" title="环境准备"></a>环境准备</h2><h3 id="Node-js"><a href="#Node-js" class="headerlink" title="Node.js"></a>Node.js</h3><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">Windows</button><button type="button" class="tab">Mac</button><button type="button" class="tab">Linux</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><p>推荐使用 nvs（Node Version Switcher）管理版本：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 下载 nvs</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> https://github.com/jasongin/nvs.git</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> nvs</span><br><span class="line">./nvs.sh add lts</span><br><span class="line">nvs use lts</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>或直接去 <a href="https://nodejs.org/">nodejs.org</a> 下载 LTS 安装包。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 使用 Homebrew</span></span><br><span class="line">brew install node</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证</span></span><br><span class="line">node -v</span><br><span class="line">npm -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Ubuntu/Debian</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_lts.x | <span class="built_in">sudo</span> -E bash -</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install -y nodejs</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Fedora</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> dnf install nodejs</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><h3 id="Git"><a href="#Git" class="headerlink" title="Git"></a>Git</h3><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">Windows</button><button type="button" class="tab">Mac</button><button type="button" class="tab">Linux</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><p>去 <a href="https://git-scm.com/">git-scm.com</a> 下载安装包，一路下一步。<br>安装后右键菜单会出现 “Git Bash Here”。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew install git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div><div class="tab-item-content"><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Ubuntu/Debian</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install git</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Fedora</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> dnf install git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><hr><h2 id="安装-Hexo"><a href="#安装-Hexo" class="headerlink" title="安装 Hexo"></a>安装 Hexo</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 替换 npm 源为国内镜像</span></span><br><span class="line">npm config <span class="built_in">set</span> registry https://registry.npmmirror.com</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 全局安装 hexo-cli</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-cli -g</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="初始化博客"><a href="#初始化博客" class="headerlink" title="初始化博客"></a>初始化博客</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 新建博客文件夹（建议非系统盘）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">mkdir</span> D:/blog/superBrain</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> D:/blog/superBrain</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 初始化</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安装依赖</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 本地预览</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>浏览器打开 <code>http://localhost:4000</code> 看到默认主题即成功。</p><hr><h2 id="部署到-GitHub"><a href="#部署到-GitHub" class="headerlink" title="部署到 GitHub"></a>部署到 GitHub</h2><h3 id="1-新建仓库"><a href="#1-新建仓库" class="headerlink" title="1. 新建仓库"></a>1. 新建仓库</h3><p>仓库名必须是 <code>用户名.github.io</code>，例如 <code>QINchao998314.github.io</code>。</p><h3 id="2-配置-SSH-密钥"><a href="#2-配置-SSH-密钥" class="headerlink" title="2. 配置 SSH 密钥"></a>2. 配置 SSH 密钥</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 生成密钥</span></span><br><span class="line">ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C <span class="string">&quot;你的邮箱&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看公钥</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cat</span> ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>复制公钥 → GitHub → Settings → SSH and GPG keys → New SSH key。</p><p>测试连接：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ssh -T git@github.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-配置-Git-用户"><a href="#3-配置-Git-用户" class="headerlink" title="3. 配置 Git 用户"></a>3. 配置 Git 用户</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.name <span class="string">&quot;你的用户名&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email <span class="string">&quot;你的邮箱&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-安装部署插件"><a href="#4-安装部署插件" class="headerlink" title="4. 安装部署插件"></a>4. 安装部署插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-修改-config-yml"><a href="#5-修改-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="5. 修改 _config.yml"></a>5. 修改 <code>_config.yml</code></h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repository:</span> <span class="string">git@github.com:用户名/用户名.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-部署命令"><a href="#6-部署命令" class="headerlink" title="6. 部署命令"></a>6. 部署命令</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean    <span class="comment"># 清理缓存</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g        <span class="comment"># 生成静态文件</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo d        <span class="comment"># 部署到 GitHub</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>访问 <code>https://用户名.github.io</code> 即可。</p><hr><h2 id="常用命令速查"><a href="#常用命令速查" class="headerlink" title="常用命令速查"></a>常用命令速查</h2><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>hexo new &quot;文章标题&quot;</code></td><td>新建文章</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo new page &quot;页面名&quot;</code></td><td>新建独立页面</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo g</code></td><td>生成静态文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo s</code></td><td>本地预览</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo d</code></td><td>部署</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo clean</code></td><td>清理 public 和 cache</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="常见问题"><a href="#常见问题" class="headerlink" title="常见问题"></a>常见问题</h2><p><strong>Q: 4000 端口被占用？</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo s -p 4001</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Q: 部署后样式丢失？</strong><br>检查 <code>_config.yml</code> 的 <code>url</code> 和 <code>root</code> 配置。</p><p><strong>Q: 文章中文标题 URL 乱码？</strong><br>安装 <code>hexo-abbrlink</code> 生成唯一链接，见 Butterfly 配置篇。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> Hexo 教程 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
        <tags>
            
            <tag> Hexo </tag>
            
            <tag> GitHub </tag>
            
            <tag> 博客搭建 </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>Hexo 博客优化完整路线</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/06/Hexo%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E8%B7%AF%E7%BA%BF/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/06/Hexo%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E8%B7%AF%E7%BA%BF/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="优化路线总览"><a href="#优化路线总览" class="headerlink" title="优化路线总览"></a>优化路线总览</h2><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">搭建博客 → GitHub Actions → 第三方托管 → 静态资源优化 → CDN 加速</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="博客搭建"><a href="#博客搭建" class="headerlink" title="博客搭建"></a>博客搭建</h2><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">Windows</button><button type="button" class="tab">Ubuntu</button><button type="button" class="tab">Android</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><p>最推荐的本地开发环境。</p><ol><li>安装 Node.js LTS</li><li>安装 Git</li><li><code>npm install hexo-cli -g</code></li><li><code>hexo init</code> 初始化</li></ol></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>适合服务器部署和命令行熟悉者。<br>建议先配置好 zsh + vim 开发环境。</p></div><div class="tab-item-content"><p>用 Termux 终端模拟器，功能有限。<br>适合临时写文章，不适合长期开发。</p></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><hr><h2 id="GitHub-Actions-自动部署"><a href="#GitHub-Actions-自动部署" class="headerlink" title="GitHub Actions 自动部署"></a>GitHub Actions 自动部署</h2><p>把本地的 <code>hexo g -d</code> 放到线上自动跑。</p><p><strong>好处</strong>：</p><ul><li>本地只写文章，<code>git push</code> 就自动部署</li><li>源码版本管理，出错随时回滚</li><li>增量提交，速度快</li></ul><p>需要在 GitHub 仓库新建 <code>.github/workflows/deploy.yml</code>。</p><hr><h2 id="托管平台对比"><a href="#托管平台对比" class="headerlink" title="托管平台对比"></a>托管平台对比</h2><div class="tabs"><div class="nav-tabs"><button type="button" class="tab active">Vercel</button><button type="button" class="tab">Netlify</button><button type="button" class="tab">Cloudflare Pages</button><button type="button" class="tab">Gitee Pages</button></div><div class="tab-contents"><div class="tab-item-content active"><ul><li>优点：免费 CDN，部署简单</li><li>缺点：国内访问慢</li><li>适合：面向海外读者</li></ul></div><div class="tab-item-content"><ul><li>优点：功能丰富，支持表单</li><li>缺点：国内访问慢</li><li>适合：需要额外功能</li></ul></div><div class="tab-item-content"><ul><li>优点：全球 CDN，免费</li><li>缺点：workers.dev 域名被墙，需绑自定义域名</li><li>适合：有自己域名的用户</li></ul></div><div class="tab-item-content"><ul><li>优点：国内访问快</li><li>缺点：需实名认证，容量有限</li><li>适合：纯国内读者</li></ul></div></div><div class="tab-to-top"><button type="button" aria-label="scroll to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button></div></div><hr><h2 id="多线部署"><a href="#多线部署" class="headerlink" title="多线部署"></a>多线部署</h2><p>通过 DNS 按线路分流：</p><ul><li>境外访问 → GitHub Pages</li><li>电信用户 → Vercel</li><li>移动用户 → Netlify</li></ul><p>注意：不同平台 SSL 证书不通用，不要强制 HTTPS。</p><hr><h2 id="静态资源优化"><a href="#静态资源优化" class="headerlink" title="静态资源优化"></a>静态资源优化</h2><table><thead><tr><th>优化项</th><th>效果</th><th>难度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>图片压缩</td><td>减小 50%+ 体积</td><td>简单</td></tr><tr><td>CDN 加速</td><td>静态资源加载快</td><td>简单</td></tr><tr><td>异步加载</td><td>首屏快</td><td>中等</td></tr><tr><td>Gulp 压缩</td><td>自动压缩</td><td>较难</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote><p>注意：jsdelivr 国内速度已变差，慎用。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="PWA-pjax-Gulp"><a href="#PWA-pjax-Gulp" class="headerlink" title="PWA &#x2F; pjax &#x2F; Gulp"></a>PWA &#x2F; pjax &#x2F; Gulp</h2><p>这三个并称”bug 御三家”：</p><ul><li><strong>PWA</strong>：功能非刚需，bug 多，难卸载</li><li><strong>pjax</strong>：页面无刷新，但容易出兼容问题</li><li><strong>Gulp</strong>：配置繁琐，提升有限</li></ul><p>非刚需别硬上。</p><hr><h2 id="全站-CDN"><a href="#全站-CDN" class="headerlink" title="全站 CDN"></a>全站 CDN</h2><p>国内 CDN 必须备案，这是硬性要求。</p><p>备案流程：</p><ol><li>国内注册域名（阿里云&#x2F;腾讯云）</li><li>域名服务商提交备案</li><li>客服初审材料</li><li>管局审核（3天~1个月）</li></ol><p>没有备案号用不了国内 CDN。</p>]]></content>
      
      
